continue [SimTalk]
The keyword continue skips the rest of the loop iteration and continues with the next iteration.
Remarks
If the current iteration was the last iteration, continue exits the loop.
If you want to continue with the next iteration for an outer loop, specify an integer value with the number
of loops for which continue is to apply after the keyword continue.
If you type in continue 2 for example, Plant Simulation exits the inner loop and executes the next
iteration of the outer loop.
